This document tells about socket reconnection and messages retry strategies of Relay.

---

# Socket.io Reconnection flow

Socket Connected
↓
network drops/server unavailable
↓
Socket disconnected
↓
Socket.IO attempts reconnection
↓
Current access token
↓
Access token expired?
↓
Refresh and store access token
↓
connected again
↓
message synchronization + start message retry

## Socket.io Configuration

reconnection: true
reconnectionAttempts: 5
reconnectionDelay: 1000ms
reconnectionDelayMax: 10000ms
randomizationFactor: default

- do not retry socket.io reconnection if network is not available.
